name 'ai-and-algorithmic-decisions-postassessment-q13_2026'

question 'A smart-home app turns on the porch light when motion is detected but only if it is not already bright outside. Which combination of operators handles this?'

wrong 'AND only — both conditions must be true.'
right 'AND with NOT — motion is detected AND it is NOT already bright.'
wrong 'OR only — either condition triggers the light.'
wrong 'No operator — the light just runs on a timer.'

allow_multiple_attempts true

